|description             = You are on an enemy's Profane Ground, increasing the effect of Curses on you and making you easier to critically hit.
}}

'''Profane ground''' is a detrimental [[ground effect]] that applies 100% increased [[critical strike]] chance and 10% increased [[curse]] effect against enemies standing on the ground.

==Related unique items==
The following [[unique item]]s are related to Profane Ground:
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=items.stat_text LIKE "%Profane Ground%"
|large=1
|base_item=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}

==Related passive skills==
The table below displays [[passive skills]] related to profane ground.

===Bloodline Ascendancy passive skills===
{{Query passive skills
|where=
  passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%profane%" AND passive_skills.id LIKE "%AlternateAscendancy%"
}}

==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
* Hits against Enemies on Profane Ground have 100% increased Critical Strike Chance, and Curses have 10% increased Effect on them (previously Enemies had -10% to all Resistances, and Hits against them had 100% increased Critical Strike Chance).
}}
{{Version history table row|3.21.0|
* Fixed an issue where the reminder text for Profane Ground incorrectly stated hits against enemies have +1% to Critical Strike Chance, when it is really 100% increased Critical Strike Chance. This is not a functional change.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.11.0|
* Introduced to the game: {{il|Broken Faith}} now causes you to create Profane Ground instead of Consecrated Ground.
}}
{{Version history table end}}

